          "total exposure stated as 125000.00, seven debits sum to 126699.00",
          "claim 7 cites {{EV_MISSING}} — dangling evidence reference",
          "claim 8 has no citation at all",
          "claim 5 asserts approvals on 2026-04-04, a date with no statement activity"
